-content\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/40px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/Ambox_important.svg/120px-Ambox_important.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"40\" data-file-height=\"40\" /></span></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目需要<b>精通或熟悉相關主題的編者</b>參與及協助編輯。<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"><br /><small>請<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%B0%88%E5%AE%B6%E9%82%80%E8%AB%8B%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%B0%8F%E7%B5%84\" title=\"Wikipedia:專家邀請工作小組\">邀請</a>適合的人士<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%BE&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%BE&amp;action=edit\">改善本條目</a>。更多的細節與詳情請參見<a href=\"/wiki/Talk:%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%BE\" title=\"Talk:果乾\">討論頁</a>。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173184\" /><table class=\"box-Expand&#95;language plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-notice\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/60px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/120px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></span></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目<b>可參照<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dried_fruit\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Dried fruit\">英語維基百科</a>相應條目來擴充</b>。<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"><br /><small>若您熟悉來源語言和主題，請協助<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E7%BF%BB%E8%AF%91%E5%AE%88%E5%88%99\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:翻譯守則\">參考外語維基百科擴充條目</a>。請勿直接提交機械翻譯，也不要翻譯不可靠、低品質內容。依<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%9C%A8%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E7%99%BE%E7%A7%91%E5%86%85%E5%A4%8D%E5%88%B6%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9\" title=\"Wikipedia:在維基百科內複製內容\">版權協議</a>，譯文需<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81#翻譯文章\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:編輯摘要\">在編輯摘要註明來源</a>，或於討論頁頂部標記<code>{{<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Translated_page\" title=\"Template:Translated page\">Translated page</a>}}</code>標籤。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:DriedfruitS.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/DriedfruitS.jpg/250px-DriedfruitS.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"238\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/DriedfruitS.jpg/500px-DriedfruitS.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"667\" data-file-height=\"634\" /></a><figcaption>各款果乾</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>果乾</b>（英語：<span lang=\"en\">Dried fruit</span>）是已去除<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B0%B4%E4%BB%BD\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"水份\">水份</a>的水果<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-水果華麗變身&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-水果華麗變身-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>，通常用日曬、烘乾等方法。常見的果乾有<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84\" title=\"葡萄\">葡萄</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A4%B0%E6%A3%97\" title=\"椰棗\">椰棗</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2%E6%9D%8E\" title=\"歐洲李\">歐洲李</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A2%85\" title=\"梅\">梅</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9D%8F\" title=\"杏\">杏</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%94%93%E8%B6%8A%E6%A9%98\" title=\"蔓越橘\">蔓越橘</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%84%A1%E8%8A%B1%E6%9E%9C\" title=\"無花果\">無花果</a>等。<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E7%B4%A2%E4%B8%8D%E8%BE%BE%E7%B1%B3%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"美索不達米亞\">美索不達米亞</a>4000多年前就已出現果乾。\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"東亞常見果乾\"><span id=\".E6.9D.B1.E4.BA.9E.E5.B8.B8.E8.A6.8B.E6.9E.9C.E4.B9.BE\"></span>東亞常見果乾</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：東亞常見果乾\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Mangues_sechees.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Mangues_sechees.jpg/250px-Mangues_sechees.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Mangues_sechees.jpg/500px-Mangues_sechees.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3072\" data-file-height=\"2304\" /></a><figcaption>芒果乾</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%92%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%BE\" title=\"芒果乾\">芒果乾</a></li>\n<li>芭樂乾</li>\n<li>鳳梨乾</li>\n<li>榴槤乾</li></ul>\n<p>此外還有<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%89%E8%8E%93\" title=\"草莓\">草莓</a>乾、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%95%AA%E8%8C%84\" title=\"番茄\">番茄</a>乾等物。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"相關\"><span id=\".E7.9B.B8.E9.97.9C\"></span>相關</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：相關\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9C%9C%E9%A4%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"蜜餞\">蜜餞</a>，果乾的一種</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"参考资料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.82.E8.80.83.E8.B5.84.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%9C%E4%B9%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95310437\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-水果華麗變身-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-水果華麗變身_1-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r